  << /ActualText (Developed a traditional dice game with 3D dice shaking and clean Swift\057UIKit interface\056\nBuilt a 3D scanning app that converts spaces into 2D room layouts with evacuation planning and export features\056\nBuilt a 3D scanning app that provides 3D room layout with its Dimensions on Upwork\056\nLed hands\055on sessions on Arduino and IoT with ESP\054 guiding students in building real\055world robotics projects over one month\056\nCoordinated with remote project teams and task as per objectives\056\nResearched \046 worked with professional developers to complete insurance calculator\054 intregating esewa\054 khalti and prabhu pay and QR scan application\nMade text to video app \050i\056e\056 \054ImaginAI\051 with Flutter \054 which takes prompt from user which generate voiceover script \054 then attach it to video generated with the prompt\nDesigned and developed a focus mode feature for the Norvic Reset app using Flutter\054 allowing users to lock the app for customizable durations across multiple sessions and force the device to remain on a single app screen for uninterrupted productivity\056\nWorked on Ad analysis app \050i\056e\056 \054Ad monkey\051)
